# AGENTS.md

## Project Identity

This workspace is a generated React detail page focused on `{{TITLE}}`.

## Runtime Stack

- React
- Material UI v6
- TypeScript
- Vite
- Vitest
- pnpm

## Local Structure

- `src/DetailPage.tsx` is the main detail view for `{{ENTITY_NAME}}`.
- `src/Form.tsx` contains the editable form surface.
- `src/api.ts` contains the mock data layer.
- `src/types.ts` contains the core `{{ENTITY_NAME}}` types.

## Working Rules

- Prefer incremental changes over broad rewrites.
- Keep the detail surface and the form aligned rather than diverging into separate patterns.
- Put reusable visual decisions in the theme/provider layer instead of scattering overrides.
- Do not confuse this workspace `AGENTS.md` with `.github/agents/*`; this file documents the local project, not the Copilot bundle.

## Validation

- For UI-only changes, run the smallest relevant validation first.
- For form changes, verify read mode, edit mode, save/cancel, and loading/error states.
- For broader changes, use `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm test`, and `pnpm build` as needed.

## Nested AGENTS

- Add nested `AGENTS.md` files only when a subdirectory becomes a real local boundary with different rules.
